Description: enable V-Sync
 The intro never set a swap interval, so it rendered as fast as possible.
 Call SDL_GL_SetSwapInterval(1) right after SDL_GL_CreateContext.
 Timing is based on SDL_GetTicks(), so the playback speed is unchanged.
Author: Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>
Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-17
--- a/src/intro.cpp
+++ b/src/intro.cpp
@@ -937,6 +937,8 @@
       (flag_fullscreen ? SDL_WINDOW_FULLSCREEN_DESKTOP : 0));
   dnload_SDL_GL_CreateContext(g_window);
 #if defined(USE_LD)
+  // Enable V-Sync, must be called after the context has been created.
+  SDL_GL_SetSwapInterval(1);
   g_fullscreen = flag_fullscreen;
   SetViewportAspect(g_window);
 #endif
